/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `services` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `services` VALUES ('accommodation-guidance','accommodation-guidance','Student Accommodation Guidance','Safe, verified, and budget-friendly student housing near campus with vetted private providers and on-campus dorms.','Securing clean, safe, and reasonably priced housing in international cities like London, New York, Melbourne, or Toronto can be daunting. We partner directly with leading Purpose-Built Student Accommodation (PBSA) providers like AmberStudent, Student.com, and Unite Students to book verified studios, ensuite rooms, and shared apartments before you land.','Building2','[\"Exclusive student booking discounts and waived security deposit deals\",\"Direct comparison between On-Campus Halls vs. Off-Campus PBSA apartments\",\"Lease agreement verification preventing rental fraud and scams\",\"Roommate matching service connecting you with peers from your intake\"]','[\"Curated accommodation shortlists within 15â€“30 minutes transit from campus\",\"Confirmed tenancy agreement assistance with utility bill inclusions\",\"Neighborhood safety and commute route analysis\"]','All admitted students preparing for relocation.','2â€“4 days after offer confirmation',8,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('admission-guidance','admission-guidance','Admission Guidance & Global Strategy','End-to-end strategic oversight through every phase of the university admissions cycle to secure fast-track offer letters.','Top universities review tens of thousands of international applications each cycle. Standing out requires strategic narrative framing, immaculate document presentation, and strict adherence to institutional guidelines. We guide you through prerequisite fulfillment, credit transfer evaluations, portfolio reviews, and referee selection to craft an undeniable candidate profile.','GraduationCap','[\"Dedicated Senior Admissions Advisor overseeing your portfolio\",\"Faculty-specific advice on departmental expectations\",\"Guidance on securing high-impact Academic Letters of Recommendation (LORs)\",\"Direct liaison with university international recruitment offices\"]','[\"Application timeline roadmap with strict internal milestone deadlines\",\"Curated Academic CV formatted to international hiring/academic standards\",\"Letters of Recommendation (LOR) structure and faculty briefing kits\"]','Prospective Bachelorâ€™s, Masterâ€™s, MBA, and PhD scholars.','Ongoing support throughout application cycles',2,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 19:41:35'),('application-processing','application-processing','Application Processing & Portal Management','Flawless submission across UCAS, Common App, OUAC, Uni-Assist, and direct institutional portals with zero errors.','A single administrative mistake or miscategorized document can result in an instant rejection or months of delay. Our specialized application processing unit audits every document, verifies credential notarizations, formats transcripts, and executes portal submissions with 100% precision.','FileCheck','[\"Zero-error guarantee on portal submissions (UCAS, Common App, Uni-Assist, Direct Portals)\",\"Fee waiver access for select partner universities saving $100â€“$500 in fees\",\"Expedited offer letter follow-ups through official university partnerships\",\"Real-time application status dashboard tracking every stage\"]','[\"Complete portal submission confirmation packages\",\"Offer letter analysis and conditional offer fulfillment management\",\"Confirmation of Acceptance for Studies (CAS) / I-20 / CoE tracking\"]','Students ready to submit applications across UK, USA, Canada, Australia, and Europe.','24â€“48 hours for document dispatch upon file readiness',3,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('post-admission-support','post-admission-support','Post-Admission & On-Arrival Support','Airport pickups, local city orientation, part-time job hunting strategies, and long-term alumni mentorship.','Our relationship does not end when your flight takes off. We maintain an active overseas alumni network across the UK, North America, Australia, and Europe to assist you upon landing with airport pickups, city transit cards, NIN/SIN registration, and CV formatting for part-time job applications.','HeartHandshake','[\"Airport meet-and-greet coordination and emergency on-ground helpline\",\"Assistance with local tax numbers (NIN in UK, SIN in Canada, TFN in Australia)\",\"Part-time job search workshops (hospitality, retail, campus tutoring)\",\"Access to local city WhatsApp groups with fellow senior students\"]','[\"On-ground arrival survival kit and metro transit setup\",\"International CV & cover letter formatted for local part-time hiring\",\"Invitation to regional student meetups and networking dinners\"]','Newly arrived international scholars in host countries.','Available throughout your first semester abroad',10,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('pre-departure-guidance','pre-departure-guidance','Pre-Departure Guidance & Briefings','Comprehensive relocation readiness: packing lists, foreign exchange cards, student SIM cards, and transit protocols.','Transitioning to a foreign country involves countless practical logistics. Our interactive Pre-Departure Briefings prepare you for international flights, customs border control, currency exchange, opening a local bank account, getting student discounts, and adapting to cultural nuances.','PlaneTakeoff','[\"Live interactive pre-departure briefings with current international alumni\",\"Discounted student flight bookings with 40kg+ baggage allowances\",\"Pre-activated international eSIM cards with instant data on arrival\",\"Foreign exchange (Forex) student travel cards with zero mark-up fees\"]','[\"Comprehensive Pre-Departure Handbook (Customized by country)\",\"Immigration Border Control Checklist & Port of Entry dossier\",\"Local student banking and national health registration guides\"]','Students with approved visas preparing to travel.','Organized 4â€“6 weeks prior to intake commencement',9,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('scholarship-guidance','scholarship-guidance','Scholarship Guidance & Financial Aid','Identify and apply for merit bursaries, government scholarships, and departmental fellowships to minimize study costs.','International education is a major investment, but millions in scholarships go unclaimed every year due to lack of student awareness. Our financial aid team tracks over 1,500 active scholarships, including prestigious awards like Chevening, Fulbright, DAAD, Erasmus+, and university-specific merit waivers reducing tuition by 20% to 100%.','Award','[\"Access to exclusive institutional partner bursaries (up to Â£10,000 / $15,000)\",\"Assistance with competitive scholarship essays and diversity statements\",\"Need-based financial aid profile guidance (CSS Profile, ISFAA)\",\"Graduate assistantship (TA/RA) application strategies for STEM students\"]','[\"Personalized scholarship matrix with eligibility criteria and deadlines\",\"Edited and polished scholarship motivational essays\",\"Guidance on educational loan sanction letters with competitive interest rates\"]','High-merit students and students seeking financial sponsorship.','1â€“2 weeks prior to scholarship deadlines',4,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('sop-essay-assistance','sop-essay-assistance','SOP & Personal Statement Assistance','Compelling, plagiarism-free storytelling that transforms your background into an unforgettable admissions essay.','Admissions committees read thousands of essays; generic templates get rejected instantly. Our team of native English editors and Oxbridge/Ivy League writing coaches help you unearth your authentic story, articulate your academic passions, and explain any career gaps or anomalies with compelling professionalism.','PenTool','[\"One-on-one brainstorming call to discover your unique voice and narrative angle\",\"Rigorous multi-round structural, grammatical, and thematic editing\",\"Strict zero-AI generation, zero-plagiarism originality policy (with Turnitin report)\",\"Alignment with specific department professors and curriculum focal points\"]','[\"Master Statement of Purpose (SOP) tailored to your primary target\",\"Adaptive modular paragraphs for university-specific prompt questions\",\"Official Turnitin plagiarism and AI authenticity certificate\"]','Applicants seeking top-tier admissions and scholarship consideration.','5â€“7 business days per draft cycle',6,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('test-guidance','ielts-test-guidance','IELTS / PTE / English Test Guidance','Targeted preparation strategies, diagnostic mocks, and score booster techniques to achieve Band 7.5+ or PTE 70+.','English language proficiency is non-negotiable for university admissions and visa approvals. Whether you need to crack IELTS Academic, PTE Academic, TOEFL iBT, or Duolingo English Test, our certified trainers provide diagnostic benchmarking, customized study plans, and proven test-taking hacks.','Languages','[\"Comprehensive diagnostic test identifying your speaking, writing, and listening gaps\",\"Speaking mock evaluations with certified IELTS examiners\",\"Scoring templates for Academic Task 1 & Task 2 essay writing\",\"Strategies for test waiver requests at select UK and US institutions\"]','[\"Personalized 4-week or 8-week test prep roadmap\",\"Access to 20+ computer-delivered full-length practice tests\",\"Detailed analytical score improvement feedback reports\"]','Students preparing to take or retake English language certifications.','Flexible 2 to 8 week learning tracks',7,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('university-selection','university-selection','University Selection & Profiling','Data-driven profiling matching your academic transcripts, career trajectory, budget, and immigration goals with top-tier universities.','Choosing the right institution is the single most critical decision of your international education journey. Our seasoned senior counselors conduct a multi-dimensional assessment of your GPA, test scores, research background, financial parameters, and post-study career goals. We categorize universities into \"Dream\", \"Target\", and \"Safe\" tiers, maximizing your chance of receiving prestigious offers while guaranteeing high admission certainty.','Compass','[\"Comprehensive profile evaluation by Ivy League & Russell Group alumni\",\"Realistic Dream-Target-Safe university shortlist (6 to 10 universities)\",\"Course syllabus matching against future employment and PR regulations\",\"Tuition fee versus ROI comparison matrices\"]','[\"Personalized University Strategy Dossier\",\"Direct admissions likelihood calculation report\",\"Comprehensive intake timelines & prerequisite checklists\"]','High school seniors, undergraduate students, and working professionals planning abroad studies.','3â€“5 business days',1,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17'),('visa-consultancy','visa-consultancy','Visa Consultancy & Mock Interviews','Industry-leading 98.6% visa approval record with certified immigration advisors and rigorous mock interview simulations.','Securing your offer letter is only half the battle; obtaining your student visa requires strict compliance with immigration laws, foolproof financial documentation, and convincing communication during embassy interviews. Our licensed visa specialists prepare your financial portfolio and conduct realistic one-on-one mock interviews.','Stamp','[\"98.6% verified visa success rate across 20+ countries\",\"Full financial dossier vetting (bank statements, tax returns, sponsor affidavits, GIC/Blocked Accounts)\",\"One-on-one mock interviews simulating US F-1 embassy officers and UKVI credibility checks\",\"Immediate crisis management and emergency appointment scheduling\"]','[\"Complete visa application file with indexed supporting evidence\",\"Statement of Purpose for Visa (SOP) tailored to immigration officer standards\",\"3 recorded mock interview sessions with corrective feedback\"]','All offer holders preparing for student visa filings.','3â€“7 days from offer letter reception',5,1,'2026-10-04 18:26:17','2026-10-04 18:26:17');
